#: live-chat-for-telegram.php:240
msgid "More information about Live Chat for Telegram"
msgstr "Plus d'informations sur Live Chat for Telegram"

#: live-chat-for-telegram.php:147 live-chat-for-telegram.php:241
#: live-chat-for-telegram.php:248
msgid "Live Chat for Telegram"
msgstr "Live Chat for Telegram"

#: live-chat-for-telegram.php:242
msgid "View details"
msgstr "Voir les détails"

#: live-chat-for-telegram.php:249
msgid "🐛 Report a Bug"
msgstr "🐛 Signaler un bug"

#: includes/class-lcft-attachments.php:78
msgid "No file was received."
msgstr "Aucun fichier n'a été reçu."

#: includes/class-lcft-attachments.php:82
msgid "The file could not be uploaded."
msgstr "Le fichier n'a pas pu être envoyé."

#. translators: %s: The maximum file size, already formatted.
#: includes/class-lcft-attachments.php:92
msgid "That file is too large. The limit is %s."
msgstr "Ce fichier est trop volumineux. La limite est de %s."

#: includes/class-lcft-attachments.php:102
msgid "That file type is not allowed."
msgstr "Ce type de fichier n'est pas autorisé."

#: includes/class-lcft-attachments.php:115
msgid "The file could not be saved."
msgstr "Le fichier n'a pas pu être enregistré."

#. translators: %s: The maximum size, already formatted.
#: includes/class-lcft-attachments.php:160
msgid ""
"Telegram will not hand back files over %s, so this one could not be "
"delivered."
msgstr ""
"Telegram ne renvoie pas les fichiers de plus de %s, celui-ci n'a donc pas pu "
"être livré."

#: includes/class-lcft-attachments.php:330
msgid "The file could not be recorded."
msgstr "Le fichier n'a pas pu être enregistré en base."

#: includes/class-lcft-attachments.php:358
msgid "The upload directory could not be created."
msgstr "Le dossier d'envoi n'a pas pu être créé."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:64 includes/class-lcft-admin.php:65
msgid "Live Chat"
msgstr "Live Chat"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:99
msgid "Working…"
msgstr "Chargement…"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:100
msgid "The request failed."
msgstr "La requête a échoué."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:101
msgid "Choose an avatar"
msgstr "Choisir un avatar"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:102
msgid "Use this image"
msgstr "Utiliser cette image"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:118
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "Connexion"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:119
msgid "Widget"
msgstr "Widget"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:120
msgid "Hours"
msgstr "Horaires"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:121
msgid "Member details"
msgstr "Détails des membres"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:122 includes/class-lcft-admin.php:442
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Avancé"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:134 includes/class-lcft-admin.php:482
msgid "You are not allowed to change these settings."
msgstr "Vous n'êtes pas autorisé à modifier ces réglages."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:155
msgid "Add a bot token and a group before the chat can run."
msgstr ""
"Ajoutez un jeton de bot et un groupe avant que le chat ne puisse fonctionner."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:162
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "Réglages enregistrés."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:207 includes/class-lcft-admin.php:220
#: includes/class-lcft-diagnostics.php:67
msgid "Bot token"
msgstr "Jeton du bot"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:208
msgid ""
"is defined in wp-config.php, so the token is not stored in the database."
msgstr ""
"est défini dans wp-config.php, le jeton n'est donc pas stocké dans la base "
"de données."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:224
msgid ""
"A token is saved. The field stays empty for security — leave it blank to "
"keep it, or type a new one to replace it."
msgstr ""
"Un jeton est enregistré. Le champ reste vide pour des raisons de sécurité — "
"laissez-le vide pour le conserver, ou saisissez-en un nouveau pour le "
"remplacer."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:225
msgid "No token saved yet."
msgstr "Aucun jeton enregistré pour le moment."

#. translators: %s: A link to BotFather.
#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:229
msgid ""
"Create a bot with %s and paste its token. Use a bot dedicated to this site: "
"a bot can only deliver updates to one place."
msgstr ""
"Créez un bot avec %s et collez son jeton. Utilisez un bot dédié à ce site : "
"un bot ne peut livrer ses mises à jour qu'à un seul endroit."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:236
msgid "Group ID"
msgstr "ID du groupe"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:238
msgid ""
"The supergroup where conversations appear, for example <code>-1001234567890</"
"code>. You can paste a message link from the group instead and the ID will "
"be worked out. Topics must be enabled, and the bot must be an administrator "
"able to manage them."
msgstr ""
"Le supergroupe où apparaissent les conversations, par exemple "
"<code>-1001234567890</code>. Vous pouvez coller un lien de message du groupe "
"à la place, l'ID sera déduit automatiquement. Les sujets doivent être "
"activés, et le bot doit être administrateur avec le droit de les gérer."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:243
msgid "Status"
msgstr "État"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:244
msgid ""
"Checks run in the order a message travels, so the first failure is the one "
"to fix."
msgstr ""
"Les vérifications s'exécutent dans l'ordre de circulation d'un message, la "
"première qui échoue est donc celle à corriger."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:247
msgid "Run checks"
msgstr "Lancer les vérifications"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:248
msgid "Register webhook"
msgstr "Enregistrer le webhook"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:249
msgid "Detect group"
msgstr "Détecter le groupe"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:250
msgid "Remove webhook"
msgstr "Supprimer le webhook"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:251
msgid "Send a test message"
msgstr "Envoyer un message test"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:257
msgid "Telegram delivers updates to this address:"
msgstr "Telegram livre les mises à jour à cette adresse :"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:271
msgid "Show the bubble"
msgstr "Afficher la bulle"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:272
msgid "Display the chat bubble on the site"
msgstr "Afficher la bulle de chat sur le site"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:276
msgid "Support name"
msgstr "Nom du support"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:278
msgid ""
"Shown to the member on every reply. A single name for the whole team is "
"intentional: they are talking to a support desk, not to whichever phone "
"answered."
msgstr ""
"Affiché au membre à chaque réponse. Un nom unique pour toute l'équipe est "
"volontaire : le membre s'adresse à un service de support, pas à celui qui a "
"répondu depuis son téléphone."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:281
msgid "Avatar URL"
msgstr "URL de l'avatar"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:284
msgid "Welcome message"
msgstr "Message d'accueil"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:286
msgid "Shown above the conversation when the member has never written."
msgstr ""
"Affiché au-dessus de la conversation lorsque le membre n'a encore jamais "
"écrit."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:290
msgid "Position"
msgstr "Position"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:294
msgid "Bottom right"
msgstr "En bas à droite"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:295
msgid "Bottom left"
msgstr "En bas à gauche"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:300
msgid "Accent colour"
msgstr "Couleur d'accent"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php
msgid "Use the theme's main colour when it defines one (Divi 5, block themes)"
msgstr "Utiliser la couleur principale du thème quand il en définit une (Divi 5, thèmes blocs)"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php
msgid "The colour picked here is used otherwise."
msgstr "Sinon, la couleur choisie ici est utilisée."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:303
msgid "Open automatically"
msgstr "Ouverture automatique"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:304
msgid "seconds"
msgstr "secondes"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:305
msgid "Zero leaves the bubble closed until the member clicks it."
msgstr "Zéro laisse la bulle fermée jusqu'à ce que le membre clique dessus."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:309
msgid "Signed out visitors"
msgstr "Visiteurs non connectés"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:313
msgid "Show nothing"
msgstr "Ne rien afficher"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:314
msgid "Show the bubble, inviting them to sign in"
msgstr "Afficher la bulle, en les invitant à se connecter"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:317
msgid ""
"The chat itself is for signed in members only. That is what keeps spam out: "
"there is no anonymous way in."
msgstr ""
"Le chat lui-même est réservé aux membres connectés. C'est ce qui empêche le "
"spam : il n'existe aucun moyen d'y accéder anonymement."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:321
msgid "Limit to roles"
msgstr "Limiter à certains rôles"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:323
msgid "Leave everything unticked to allow every signed in user."
msgstr "Ne rien cocher pour autoriser tous les utilisateurs connectés."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:339
msgid "Opening hours"
msgstr "Horaires d'ouverture"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:340
msgid "Tell members when the desk is staffed"
msgstr "Indiquer aux membres quand le service est assuré"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:341
msgid ""
"Messages are always accepted. Outside these hours the member is told when to "
"expect an answer rather than being turned away."
msgstr ""
"Les messages sont toujours acceptés. En dehors de ces horaires, le membre "
"est informé du délai de réponse plutôt que d'être ignoré."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:358
msgid "Open"
msgstr "Ouvert"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:361
msgid "to"
msgstr "à"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:373
msgid "Exceptions"
msgstr "Exceptions"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:375
msgid ""
"One per line: <code>2026-08-15 = closed</code>, or <code>2026-08-15 = "
"09:00-12:00</code> for a short day. Exceptions override the weekly pattern."
msgstr ""
"Une par ligne : <code>2026-08-15 = closed</code>, ou <code>2026-08-15 = "
"09:00-12:00</code> pour une journée réduite. Les exceptions remplacent le "
"planning hebdomadaire."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:379
msgid "Closed message"
msgstr "Message de fermeture"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:381
msgid "Leave empty to announce the next opening automatically."
msgstr "Laisser vide pour annoncer automatiquement la prochaine ouverture."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:394
msgid ""
"Each member gets one Telegram topic, named from their details, with a card "
"pinned at the top. Gravity Forms is optional: without it the details come "
"from the WordPress account alone."
msgstr ""
"Chaque membre dispose d'un sujet Telegram, nommé d'après ses informations, "
"avec une fiche épinglée en haut. Gravity Forms est optionnel : sans lui, les "
"informations proviennent uniquement du compte WordPress."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:399
msgid "Gravity Forms form"
msgstr "Formulaire Gravity Forms"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:402
msgid "The form members register with. Zero disables the lookup."
msgstr "Le formulaire d'inscription des membres. Zéro désactive la recherche."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:403
msgid "Gravity Forms is not active, so this is ignored."
msgstr "Gravity Forms n'est pas actif, ce réglage est donc ignoré."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:407
msgid "Field map"
msgstr "Correspondance des champs"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:409
msgid ""
"One per line, <code>name = field ID</code>. Each name becomes a "
"<code>{placeholder}</code> below. <code>user_id</code> and <code>email</"
"code> are also used to match a member to their entry."
msgstr ""
"Une par ligne, <code>nom = ID du champ</code>. Chaque nom devient un "
"<code>{placeholder}</code> ci-dessous. <code>user_id</code> et <code>email</"
"code> servent aussi à associer un membre à son entrée."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:413
msgid "Topic title"
msgstr "Titre du sujet"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:415
msgid ""
"Placeholders that resolve to nothing are removed, along with the punctuation "
"left around them."
msgstr ""
"Les placeholders qui ne renvoient rien sont supprimés, ainsi que la "
"ponctuation qui les entoure."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:419
msgid "Pinned card"
msgstr "Fiche épinglée"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:421
msgid "Telegram HTML: <code>&lt;b&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;i&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;u&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;s&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;tg-spoiler&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;a&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;code&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;pre&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;blockquote&gt;</code>. Other tags are removed. Leave empty for a default card built from the account. Whatever you put here is sent to Telegram, so only include what the team needs."
msgstr "HTML Telegram : <code>&lt;b&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;i&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;u&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;s&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;tg-spoiler&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;a&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;code&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;pre&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;blockquote&gt;</code>. Les autres balises sont retirées. Laisser vide pour une fiche par défaut construite à partir du compte. Tout ce qui est saisi ici est envoyé à Telegram, n'incluez donc que ce dont l'équipe a besoin."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:437
msgid "Attachments"
msgstr "Pièces jointes"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:438
msgid "Let members send files"
msgstr "Autoriser les membres à envoyer des fichiers"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:442
msgid "Emoji"
msgstr "Emoji"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:443
msgid "Let members insert emoji from the composer"
msgstr "Autoriser les membres à insérer des emojis depuis le champ de saisie"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:447
msgid "Maximum upload"
msgstr "Envoi maximum"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:448
msgid "bytes"
msgstr "octets"

#. translators: %s: The download limit, already formatted.
#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:451
msgid ""
"Telegram accepts up to 50 MB, but only hands files back under %s — so a "
"reply carrying a larger file cannot reach the member."
msgstr ""
"Telegram accepte jusqu'à 50 Mo, mais ne renvoie que les fichiers de moins de "
"%s — une réponse contenant un fichier plus volumineux ne peut donc pas "
"atteindre le membre."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:457
msgid "Polling interval"
msgstr "Intervalle d'interrogation"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:458
msgid "milliseconds"
msgstr "millisecondes"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:459
msgid ""
"How often an open bubble checks for a reply. The widget slows down on its "
"own when the tab is in the background."
msgstr ""
"Fréquence à laquelle une bulle ouverte vérifie l'arrivée d'une réponse. Le "
"widget ralentit automatiquement lorsque l'onglet est en arrière-plan."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:463
msgid "Keep messages for"
msgstr "Conserver les messages pendant"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:464
msgid "days"
msgstr "jours"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:465
msgid ""
"Zero keeps everything. Anything else deletes older messages and their files "
"daily. The Telegram side is never touched."
msgstr ""
"Zéro conserve tout. Toute autre valeur supprime quotidiennement les anciens "
"messages et leurs fichiers. Le côté Telegram n'est jamais modifié."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:645
msgid "You are not allowed to do that."
msgstr "Vous n'êtes pas autorisé à faire cela."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:676
msgid "Webhook registered."
msgstr "Webhook enregistré."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:694
msgid "Webhook removed. Replies will no longer reach the site."
msgstr "Webhook supprimé. Les réponses n'atteindront plus le site."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:711
msgid ""
"Nothing received yet. Register the webhook, post any message in the group, "
"then try again."
msgstr ""
"Rien reçu pour le moment. Enregistrez le webhook, publiez un message dans le "
"groupe, puis réessayez."

#. translators: 1: The group name. 2: The group ID.
#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:721
msgid ""
"Found \"%1$s\" (%2$s), but Topics are turned off in it. Turn them on, then "
"detect again — converting a group changes its ID."
msgstr ""
"« %1$s » (%2$s) trouvé, mais les sujets y sont désactivés. Activez-les, puis "
"relancez la détection — convertir un groupe change son ID."

#. translators: 1: The group name. 2: The group ID.
#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:735
msgid "Saved \"%1$s\" (%2$s). Reload this page to see it in the field."
msgstr ""
"« %1$s » (%2$s) enregistré. Rechargez cette page pour le voir dans le champ."

#. translators: %s: The site name.
#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:757
msgid ""
"Test message from %s. If you can read this, the site can reach the group."
msgstr ""
"Message test depuis %s. Si vous pouvez lire ceci, le site peut joindre le "
"groupe."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:767
msgid "Sent. Check the group."
msgstr "Envoyé. Vérifiez le groupe."

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:837
msgid "Paste the token"
msgstr "Collez le jeton"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:838
msgid "Stored — type a new one to replace it"
msgstr "Enregistré — saisissez-en un nouveau pour le remplacer"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:846
msgid "Clear"
msgstr "Effacer"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:942
msgid "Choose from Media Library"
msgstr "Choisir depuis la médiathèque"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:995
msgid "Insert placeholder"
msgstr "Insérer un placeholder"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:999
msgid "Search placeholders…"
msgstr "Rechercher des placeholders…"

#. translators: %d: The field ID, used when a field has no label.
#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:1051
msgid "Field #%d"
msgstr "Champ n°%d"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:1104
msgid "Browse form fields"
msgstr "Parcourir les champs du formulaire"

#: includes/class-lcft-admin.php:1108
msgid "Search fields…"
msgstr "Rechercher des champs…"

#: includes/class-lcft-conversations.php:197
msgid "No Telegram group has been configured."
msgstr "Aucun groupe Telegram n'a été configuré."

#: includes/class-lcft-conversations.php:217
msgid "Telegram did not return a topic ID."
msgstr "Telegram n'a pas renvoyé d'ID de sujet."

#: includes/class-lcft-rest.php:121
msgid "You need to be signed in to use the chat."
msgstr "Vous devez être connecté pour utiliser le chat."

#: includes/class-lcft-rest.php:129
msgid "Your account does not have access to the chat."
msgstr "Votre compte n'a pas accès au chat."

#: includes/class-lcft-rest.php:292 includes/class-lcft-rest.php:302
msgid "File not found."
msgstr "Fichier introuvable."

#. translators: %d: The WordPress user ID.
#: includes/class-lcft-member.php:121
msgid "Member #%d"
msgstr "Membre n°%d"

#: includes/class-lcft-member.php:162
msgid "Open profile"
msgstr "Voir le profil"

#: includes/class-lcft-chat.php:43 includes/class-lcft-telegram-api.php:292
msgid "The message is empty."
msgstr "Le message est vide."

#: includes/class-lcft-chat.php:49
msgid "The conversation could not be opened."
msgstr "La conversation n'a pas pu être ouverte."

#: includes/class-lcft-chat.php:57
msgid "Attachments are not accepted."
msgstr "Les pièces jointes ne sont pas acceptées."

#: includes/class-lcft-chat.php:77
msgid "The message could not be saved."
msgstr "Le message n'a pas pu être enregistré."

#: includes/class-lcft-chat.php:201
msgid "Telegram accepted nothing."
msgstr "Telegram n'a rien accepté."

#: includes/class-lcft-github-updater.php:844
msgid "Unable to rename the update folder. Please retry or update manually."
msgstr ""
"Impossible de renommer le dossier de mise à jour. Réessayez ou effectuez la "
"mise à jour manuellement."

#: includes/class-lcft-diagnostics.php:72
msgid "No token has been set yet."
msgstr "Aucun jeton n'a encore été défini."

#. translators: %s: The error returned by Telegram.
#: includes/class-lcft-diagnostics.php:86
msgid "Telegram rejected the token: %s"
msgstr "Telegram a rejeté le jeton : %s"

#. translators: %s: The bot's username.
#: includes/class-lcft-diagnostics.php:100
msgid "Connected as @%s."
msgstr "Connecté en tant que @%s."

#: includes/class-lcft-diagnostics.php:118
msgid "Group"
msgstr "Groupe"

#: includes/class-lcft-diagnostics.php:124
msgid "No group has been set yet."
msgstr "Aucun groupe n'a encore été défini."

#. translators: %s: The error returned by Telegram.
#: includes/class-lcft-diagnostics.php:138
msgid ""
"The group could not be read: %s Add the bot to the group first, then check "
"the ID."
msgstr ""
"Le groupe n'a pas pu être lu : %s Ajoutez d'abord le bot au groupe, puis "
"vérifiez l'ID."

#. translators: %s: The group name.
#: includes/class-lcft-diagnostics.php:157
msgid ""
"\"%s\" found, but Topics are turned off. Turn them on in the group settings."
msgstr ""
"« %s » trouvé, mais les sujets sont désactivés. Activez-les dans les "
"réglages du groupe."

#. translators: %s: The group name.
#: includes/class-lcft-diagnostics.php:171
msgid "\"%s\", with Topics enabled."
msgstr "« %s », avec les sujets activés."

#: includes/class-lcft-diagnostics.php:190
msgid "Bot permissions"
msgstr "Droits du bot"

#: includes/class-lcft-diagnostics.php:193
msgid "The bot ID could not be read, so its rights were not checked."
msgstr ""
"L'ID du bot n'a pas pu être lu, ses droits n'ont donc pas été vérifiés."

#. translators: %s: The error returned by Telegram.
#: includes/class-lcft-diagnostics.php:204
msgid "The rights could not be checked: %s"
msgstr "Les droits n'ont pas pu être vérifiés : %s"

#: includes/class-lcft-diagnostics.php:216
msgid ""
"The bot is not an administrator of the group, so it cannot create topics."
msgstr ""
"Le bot n'est pas administrateur du groupe, il ne peut donc pas créer de "
"sujets."

#: includes/class-lcft-diagnostics.php:224
msgid ""
"The bot is an administrator but is missing the \"Manage topics\" permission."
msgstr "Le bot est administrateur mais n'a pas le droit « Gérer les sujets »."

#: includes/class-lcft-diagnostics.php:228
msgid "Administrator, with permission to manage topics."
msgstr "Administrateur, avec le droit de gérer les sujets."

#: includes/class-lcft-diagnostics.php:242
msgid "Webhook"
msgstr "Webhook"

#. translators: %s: The error returned by Telegram.
#: includes/class-lcft-diagnostics.php:251
msgid "The webhook could not be read: %s"
msgstr "Le webhook n'a pas pu être lu : %s"

#: includes/class-lcft-diagnostics.php:261
msgid ""
"No webhook is registered. Replies from Telegram will not reach the site."
msgstr ""
"Aucun webhook n'est enregistré. Les réponses de Telegram n'atteindront pas "
"le site."

